{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word","id":1334460,"title":"On being the lone supernatural (exalt) in modern word","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-08T08:19:39-07:00","id":1334460,"title":"On being the lone supernatural (exalt) in modern word","content":"So here's the backstory:<br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Girl wants to be a doctor. Maybe they think it's not right for a girl. Maybe they're hippies and they want her to be an environmentalist.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Either way, she wants to be one and she works for it. Sleepless nights, reading medical textbooks. Slipping away to borrow books from a library. Squeezing online lectures between homework time. Maybe she disguises herself and enters classes.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">In the end, success. She gets the credential, or graduates, or whatever.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#1A1A1B\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">And in that end, in her search for excellence and self determination amongst people who do not support her... She exalts.<br /> <br /> Determinator. Motivation is to cure both the ills of the world and of mankind. High Compassion. Think of it like 'hippy'.<br /> <br /> Skills in stealth and Larceny and Computer (lore). Medicine supernal. She starts off healing birds in the shelter. Then making medicines. Then she sneaks into the hospital under a disguise and starts healing people. People start noticing the miraculous healing. Reporters start coming in.<br /> <br /> The reveal comes when there's a 15-car pileup, and as she sends out a combo to heal them all, she begins flaring. Brightly. Very brightly. And its the age of smartphones.<br /> <br /> There is no supernatural here. There is no spirits. No thaumaturges. No elementals. No gods. Not even mortal sorcerers or the Wyld.<br /> <br /> And now this girl is the one and only solar exalted on the planet.<br /> <br /> How would you think the world would react to a solar exalted super-healer?<br /> <br /> A/n: <br /> <br /> Ok, after some confusion, here are some things. <br /> <br /> Homebrew: </span></span></span><br /> There is this homebrew hack <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_5CqA9T0dTMW7xvhRCz3uzOoHW-YKUD_kE-GeMNsJvE/pub\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...E-GeMNsJvE/pub</a><br /> <br /> I'm using. Especially the mote reactor hack and the 'core competence' hack. Mote reactor is basically a super saiyan mode. You no longer have peripheral essence, but the mote reactor lets you respire motes and will power at an absurdly fast rate compared to previous times. The brighter your anima, the faster. And the brighter it is, the more exhausting it is for you, with it basically meaning that you can go super saiyan on an unlucky wyld hunt or cure an entire city of plague... but you're going to collapse after that. <br /> <br /> 'Core Competence' hack is basically putting in all the needed necessary charms and giving it for free. Like ox bodies, integrity protecting prana, dice adder charms, and Righteous Lion Defense. In short, your exalt has the things that you would normally buy 'in-game' to not die immediately to any vaguely competent foe. It doesn't mean you'll win, but it will keep you alive. <br /> <br /> Mass-medicine charms<br /> Several charms I thought of. This is a medicine supernal, and so I have several charms, at essence 4-5, which fuck over the costs of the charms set at essence 1-3, and allow you at the mechanical level to heal groups of people instead of individuals. Its because I was kinda dissatisfied at the idea that a solar can heal a dozen people from the Supremely Deadly Dangerous plague... and then have to stop because they run out of motes while there's an entire city of people who need help. Low level solars heal people. High level ones heal cities and nations. <br /> <br /> Hopes for this story<br /> I'm hoping to really play up the messiah angle... and the MC is an atheist. No matter. Back to the business of Solars having overwhelming power, I'm hoping to throw the ball and see how the world reacts. Ranging form hysterical calls for her death, claims she is the antichrist, the government trying and to monopolize her (this may fail horribly) or attempts to use her as a hostage (would you really want to be the one that got super-healer girl shot to death by (insert crazy group)?) <br /> <br /> I'm also going to play up the messianic/ faith healer/ superhero elements. This may make her seem overpowered. Apologies for that. <br /> <br /> And probably some talk on how being catapulted into power has effects on people. Being put from 'lower class, barely making rent' to 'has people paying/ donating millions for the chance to treat their cancer/ destroyed organs' should make some internal struggle. Or papparazi. That is a thing. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12952,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","user":"Accelerator","date":". 09-24-2019, 11:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T08:36:58-07:00","id":1334464,"title":"","content":"Depends. Where is she from? Which country? Does she have strong political views? More importantly, what about religion? Because she could possibly claim (or believe, or be believed) to be the second coming of Christ, what with all the healing. Or the anti-Christ.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T09:16:16-07:00","id":1334469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334464#post1334464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Depends. Where is she from? Which country? Does she have strong political views? More importantly, what about religion? Because she could possibly claim (or believe, or be believed) to be the second coming of Christ, what with all the healing. Or the anti-Christ.</div> </div> </div> </div>Does the word 'hippie' mean anything to you?<br /> <br /> Strong political views? Yes! (she wouldn't really be a solar exalt without something that would cause her to come into conflict with the powers that be) <br /> <br /> Atheist. Not that it'll dissuade the crazies.<br /> <br /> I'm thinking either American or British. <br /> <br /> Alternatively, setting this story in PRC China can be nice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T09:27:11-07:00","id":1334472,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334469#post1334469\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Does the word 'hippie' mean anything to you?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but it doesn't answer all the questions. &quot;Hippies&quot; can have a big variety of religious views. And be from a variety of countries. But American or British, sure. There's likely a big difference in how religious groups react to her based on that though; it'd likely be very different in Britain than America.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Alternatively, setting this story in PRC China can be nice. </div> </div> </div>Now that'd be radically different. The government would be all over her. I mean, they would be in America or Britain too, but they're less likely to arrest her family if she doesn't play ball.<br /> <br /> It is worth noting that, even with smartphones, if she tries to hide (and it sounds like she is) then a lot of people might well assume it's a hoax.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 09-08-2019, 12:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T09:38:46-07:00","id":1334475,"title":"","content":"Someone is getting sniped.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T09:49:05-07:00","id":1334477,"title":"","content":"I don't think that the government would, but in America I could definitely see her becoming a target for a nutty extremist sniper.<br /> <br /> Not in Britain, but that doesn't mean she might not attract a disturbed person who might try to kill her a different way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T10:32:41-07:00","id":1334487,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334477#post1334477\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think that the government would</div> </div> </div> </div>Hippie with superpowers.<br /> <br /> You think a drone strike then? I was thinking a sniper leaves more for the dissection, but I guess the government agents might think the power resides in the brain.<br /> <br /> Look at Bin Laden. The government is not above sending in a kill-team for targets of interest. I don't see this girl getting due process, let alone life, liberty and happiness. This is a text book Ruby Ridge/Waco Massacre.<br /> <br /> [Edit]<br /> <br /> Ok, I just described the set up to my partner who asked &quot;what if she's white?&quot;<br /> <br /> ... I guess I've got a lot of racial baggage tied up with this, so I'm going to bow out here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 09-08-2019, 01:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T11:02:51-07:00","id":1334494,"title":"","content":"Just like with your proposed War Supernal Japanese soldier in World War 2, Accelerator, there's no single straightforward ultimate answer. What do <i>you</i> want to have happen?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 09-08-2019, 02:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T11:47:41-07:00","id":1334503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334487#post1334487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hippie with superpowers.<br /> <br /> You think a drone strike then? I was thinking a sniper leaves more for the dissection, but I guess the government agents might think the power resides in the brain.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think they'd want her alive first.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>&quot;JohnDoe244</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, I just described the set up to my partner who asked &quot;what if she's white?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>And attractive, articulate and on TV.<br /> <br /> There's a lot of variations that could happen depending on who and where she is.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T12:55:27-07:00","id":1334512,"title":"","content":"I think that if the government had full knowledge about everything a Solar Exalt can become capable of, in a general sense, they would definitely want her dead before she could grow too powerful. I'm not sure I'd blame them.<br /> <br /> She isn't described as having particularly strong social skills, but it doesn't take all that much investment in the relevant Abilities and Charms for a Solar to reach frightening levels of social ability, from a mortal's perspective. Seriously, just imagine if there was someone out there who disagrees with your strongly held political views and is so persuasive that they could easily convince you if you ever listened. That's <i>terrifying</i>.<br /> <br /> However, if she is known primarily as a healer and her potential to become amazingly powerful in <i>any</i> endeavor isn't really understood, her survival chances are a lot better. I think scientists would want to study her extensively, trying to figure out how her abilities work and whether they could be replicated somehow. (No, the scientists wouldn't cut her open to study her. They're not going to destroy their only test subject.)<br /> <br /> If she can cure otherwise-incurable diseases, wealthy people who have those are going to offer a lot of money for her to visit them. (If I were in her position, I'd probably take the money. I might end up donating large portions of the money to causes I supported, but I'd certainly take it.) People who don't have a lot of money will still bombard her with offers of whatever they can afford to pay, or just beg her to help them (understandably).<br /> <br /> It's going to be a huge mess. Think about what it's like for people who win the lottery, except dramatically more so -- there are any number of people with money, but she's totally unique. There's only one shiny miracle healer, and there are a <i>lot</i> more people who need her help than she could ever get around to helping.<br /> <br /> ...Things might get a little better if she can figure out how to mass-produce seven bounties paste, age-staving cordial and other natural-magic stuff from Creation, but the components probably aren't available on Earth.<br /> <br /> (If I were the lone Exalt in a normal modern world, I would be absolutely desperate to remain a secret, because <i>yikes</i>.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T13:10:50-07:00","id":1334514,"title":"","content":"Let's not forget that the Vatican would send people sniffing the second the word &quot;miracle&quot; gets used to describe her work. Especially if she shows anima while working.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T14:46:22-07:00","id":1334538,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334514#post1334514\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Let's not forget that the Vatican would send people sniffing the second the word &quot;miracle&quot; gets used to describe her work. Especially if she shows anima while working.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure they would, but is that particularly important? No doubt every religious authority will have very strong opinions one way or another, but I'm not sure that matters except to devoutly religious people who take those authorities very seriously (and the former doesn't necessarily imply the latter).<br /> <br /> Admittedly, I'd be curious which way the Vatican would fall on that one. I don't think they would be too keen to denounce someone who's flinging glorious healing magic around, but could they really accept an atheist as a wielder of divine miracles?<br /> <br /> Perhaps more interesting: if the Catholic church did proclaim that the Solar healer is some kind of witch and not a font of divine miracles, do you think that a Catholic person with terminal cancer (or whatever) would let that stop them from asking her for help? Perhaps <i>some</i> would, but desperate people are good at justifying things to themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T15:05:45-07:00","id":1334542,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334538#post1334538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sure they would, but is that particularly important?</div> </div> </div> </div>I didn't feel it was <i>important</i> so much as <i>interesting</i>.<br /> <br /> \u200bBut then again, I'm the kind of guy who'd want to watch a Marvel movie centered around a Christian single dad having a crisis of faith in the aftermath of the Battle of New York, after the world at large learned that yes, Thor and Loki are objectively real people, and ultimately apologizing to and seeking to reconcile with the daughter he disowned a year prior when she came out to him as trans.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T15:31:17-07:00","id":1334545,"title":"","content":"Girl gets dissected in the govmt lab , the end.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12796-beast-of-bitter-oblivion","name":"Beast of Bitter Oblivion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12796_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T16:52:43-07:00","id":1334555,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334538#post1334538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">but I'm not sure that matters except to devoutly religious people who take those authorities very seriously (and the former doesn't necessarily imply the latter).</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that, when someone is performing the miraculous and there's no scientific explanation, many (not all, but many) people are going to take alternate (religious, sci-fi theories like she's psychic or an alien, etc) explanations more seriously.<br /> <br /> The point about her being an atheist is a good one; she can hardly be a Saint if she's an atheist.<br /> I can definitely see Millenial Dispensationalists (especially if she's American) considering her the anti-Christ. The Catholic Church probably not though. They may investigate, but the Pope is likely to argue that there's a scientific explanation first, or just say &quot;we don't know&quot; as they do on some issues. Not to say everyone in the Church will have the same response.<br /> <br /> I guess actually it's quite significant as to what she says. I mean, she presumably won't say &quot;it's a miracle from God&quot;... so what does she tell people? Magic? Aliens? &quot;I don't know?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T16:59:46-07:00","id":1334556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334555#post1334555\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that, when someone is performing the miraculous and there's no scientific explanation, many (not all, but many) people are going to take alternate (religious, sci-fi theories like she's psychic or an alien, etc) explanations more seriously.<br /> <br /> The point about her being an atheist is a good one; she can hardly be a Saint if she's an atheist.<br /> I can definitely see Millenial Dispensationalists (especially if she's American) considering her the anti-Christ. The Catholic Church probably not though. They may investigate, but the Pope is likely to argue that there's a scientific explanation first, or just say &amp;quot;we don't know&amp;quot; as they do on some issues. Not to say everyone in the Church will have the same response.<br /> <br /> I guess actually it's quite significant as to what she says. I mean, she presumably won't say &amp;quot;it's a miracle from God&amp;quot;... so what does she tell people? Magic? Aliens? &amp;quot;I don't know?&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>She would say that she has no idea. She only got an idea something was happening when she Exalted. She only realized there was something more to it than a lightshow when she healed a bird with a broken wing in a day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T18:02:45-07:00","id":1334560,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jefepato</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334512#post1334512\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that if the government had full knowledge about everything a Solar Exalt can become capable of, in a general sense, they would definitely want her dead before she could grow too powerful. I'm not sure I'd blame them.<br /> <br /> She isn't described as having particularly strong social skills, but it doesn't take all that much investment in the relevant Abilities and Charms for a Solar to reach frightening levels of social ability, from a mortal's perspective. Seriously, just imagine if there was someone out there who disagrees with your strongly held political views and is so persuasive that they could easily convince you if you ever listened. That's <i>terrifying</i>.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. I have her socially awkward. Lots of 'urgh' and social faux pas. She, at least, won't be making friends fast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-08T18:58:39-07:00","id":1334564,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334494#post1334494\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just like with your proposed War Supernal Japanese soldier in World War 2, Accelerator, there's no single straightforward ultimate answer. What do <i>you</i> want to have happen?</div> </div> </div> </div>Let's see now. <br /> <br /> I want things to start out slow first. First she starts at an animal shelter (after exaltation). And then interns in a hospital (much to the disapproval of her parents). And then shit happens. That long-term patient who everyone said could never get better? Just did. That comatose man who lost half his brain? Just regained consciousness. Burns, broken bones, and lacerations heal suspiciously fast. Patients that were on bad level, just... got better. They get suspicious. Guards are posted once or twice. And with them being alert, they nearly catch her. Almost. Solar power adds a burst of speed to lose them. <br /> <br /> People notice. Of course, its very coincidental and very subtle, so other than the coincidence of some strange perpetrator wandering around, it all seems like just a statistical fluke (I have a custom charm that acts like Touch of Grace/ Eternity). Nothing Obvious is happening, but anyone with a medical profession knows that something funky is up. <br /> <br /> Reporters come in, and after a few weeks of seeing people lay about in hospitals and talking to doctors, they just... leave. It just doesn't work for the ratings. Things go on as per normal, until the staff just accept that someone out there is somehow helping them. <br /> <br /> Until there's a massive car pile up, and the girl's got a choice. Walk away, and keep the secret, or walk in, and help out, and out herself? There's only one answer, and she didn't intern in a hospital to walk away from people who needed medical help. So the combo is unleashed, and she flares up to bonfire level. And when I say that, I meant 'pillar of light'. In the age of smartphones, photos and videos are already taken, with the cops and ambulances arriving to a multi-car pileup with no serious injuries. <br /> <br /> Of course, most people call it a hoax. Most people in the city saw the gigantic beam of light pumping through the atmosphere and turning night into day. Things come in, investigations are done, and... the girl just cooperates. So yes, the world knows about the superhealer. Offers come in, and people start going to her. First comes the terminal cases. Those desperate. The ones who would usually go to a faith healer and get their money fleeced. Only this time, it doesn't happen. Again and again, the healings continue. Even in controlled settings like labs and other somesuch. <br /> <br /> The wealth gained is giddying, and she starts donating it. Fast. More and more people come. Multibillionaires with blackened lungs and liver cirrhosis. The waiting list is several years long, and you can wait for a new organ and live a life on immunosuppressants, or you can go to the girl. <br /> <br /> This means power. People. Everywhere. Including unsavory ones. <br /> <br /> So she begins to do things like 'ask for favors'. And 'request' things. Fallout of this is yet undecided. <br /> <br /> So there's also the question of how her parents handle the sudden change. From lower class to quite possibly billionaires in less than a few days. Its like lottery winning, only a lot bigger. I'm not sure how to write them yet. Misguided and good people who simply believe in things like alternative medicine or assorted woo? People who see their child as a projection and a chance to do things they never had the chance to. Or are they going to be like the parents of those child stars who took advantage of their kid?<br /> <br /> Still not sure how to handle the school part. <br /> <br /> Then, of course, there's the part about the nutcases. I'm not sure how the nutcases differ from America and Britain, but I think I've seen enough religious fundamentalists to know them well enough. They'll either praise her as miraculous, or curse her as a devil and the anti-christ. Probably the anti-christ one. It can range from pastors preaching against her, protestors, or full on crazies trying to gun her down. <br /> <br /> The climax will probably be someone kidnapping her, and holding her hostage, threatening to blow her head off and themselves if their demands aren't met. The police/ SWAT will have to stop and listen, cause, well, its the miracle healer there, and losing her will mean the end of their careers. <br /> <br /> The girl just looks at her captors, and requests things for arts and crafts, because, well, she's bored. And they look at the small, scrawny little girl who's only 15 years old, and agrees to it.<br /> <br /> Bad mistake. The girl's got dots in stealth and craft, and she's a medicine supernal. After several weeks of training time, she puts on her disguise, activates a charm, and begins walking around, releasing sleeping gasses and firing the dartgun she fashioned from office supplies. In the end, all the kidnappers lie unconscious, and she walks out, unharmed. <br /> <br /> The next part of this arc, is people wondering 'how did a 15 year old girl get out of that situation', and the even more pertinent questions of 'What else can she do' or 'Is there anything she can't do'?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T01:46:26-07:00","id":1334594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then, of course, there's the part about the nutcases. I'm not sure how the nutcases differ from America and Britain, but I think I've seen enough religious fundamentalists to know them well enough.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, there are less Christian fundamentalists in Britain (remember that many early settlers in the colonies were considered religious extremists in Europe), they are less extreme (my parents were fundamentalists... who thought Creationism was idiotic and had a gay best friend), don't have the same long-standing links to racism, at least no more than anyone else (one unusual thing about fundamentalism in America is that it grew over theological developments that were used to justify slavery, in a way that isn't so true in other countries. In Britain, evangelicals were the ones who led the campaign to abolish slavery), and most importantly for your story, don't have access to guns or links to militias or a particular cultural obsession with the right to have a gun.<br /> So there might be a few preachers who say she's the anti-Christ, but they lack the influence they have in America, and their followers don't have guns.<br /> <br /> Except in Northern Ireland, whose biggest party is full of Protestant fundamentalists who hate gays, abortion, Catholics and the Irish, and have links to organised crime, paramilitary groups and crooked cops (the second largest party, who are linked to different organised crime and paramilitary groups, have links to Catholic fundamentalists but have recently abandoned their opposition to gay marriage as the new generation is a bit more liberal). But while they have political influence in government (they prop up our Conservative government), they have no real influence in British churches.<br /> <br /> Islamists do carry out terrorist attacks and murders sometimes though. Much less than in the past, but it's still there. So I could see a group like Islam4UK (previously Al Ghurabaa, previously Ahlus Sunnah wal Jamaah, previously Al-Mhajiroun) targeting this mysterious supernatural celebrity teenage girl.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Anyway. Your timeline seems reasonable and fairly well thought-out.<br /> I'd say the only thing you haven't considered is the government trying to take control of her through arrest, pressure, bribes, etc, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 09-09-2019, 04:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T03:10:50-07:00","id":1334598,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334594#post1334594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Anyway. Your timeline seems reasonable and fairly well thought-out.<br /> I'd say the only thing you haven't considered is the government trying to take control of her through arrest, pressure, bribes, etc, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Another thing I didn't think of was, well, Faith Healers. You know the ones that say 'give me money and you might be cured'. How would they feel about someone who can do say 'You can give me money if you want, and you will be cured'? Probably with words of fiery condemnations, followed by requests for charity because people are going to her instead of them. <br /> <br /> On the using of bribes and arrest, what are they going to do? Are they going to try and arrest the little girl who rescued the lives of three dozen people, and is now currently raking in support and money more than any televangelist or TV star? Pressure? So what? Unless they go into outright threats, its not going to work. Because this is a person who, age the age of 15, taught herself medicine from online. Stubborn and strong-willed, with traces of past-life memory that tell her that no, these men should be afraid of her, not the other way around. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T04:02:44-07:00","id":1334602,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334598#post1334598\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Probably with words of fiery condemnations</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine so.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Are they going to try and arrest the little girl who rescued the lives of three dozen people, and is now currently raking in support and money more than any televangelist or TV star? </div> </div> </div>I don't think they'll arrest her if she's a star.<br /> But straight after the pile-up and she saves people, etc, I think they might hold her for questioning (there's not really much you can charge her with). In that small window, the local authorities will probably be confused, shrug, and let her go.<br /> There is a small possibility that the FBI might come for her, and whisk her away to labs. I think not, because at this point they'll think it's a hoax or something. They might think it's some chemical or strange technology or something.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Pressure? So what? Unless they go into outright threats, its not going to work. Because this is a person who, age the age of 15, taught herself medicine from online. Stubborn and strong-willed, with traces of past-life memory that tell her that no, these men should be afraid of her, not the other way around. </div> </div> </div>She's got a family, doesn't she?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T04:19:47-07:00","id":1334605,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334602#post1334602\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">She's got a family, doesn't she?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Ah. Threatening the family of a Solar Exalted...<br /> <br /> The American government has made many mistakes. This may be their last one. <br /> <br /> FBI whisking her away to their labs? What would they find, other than a light show?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T04:41:19-07:00","id":1334608,"title":"","content":"Nothing, basically. Doesn't mean they won't try.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T05:32:31-07:00","id":1334618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334608#post1334608\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nothing, basically. Doesn't mean they won't try.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know, I've been wondering. Craft (genesis) is no more. And I'm making her a medicine supernal. Does that mean she can do things like 'brew up ebola and black death, version 2.0, with less weaknesses'?<br /> <br /> Urm.... the girl is blonde. White (but lower class). Not starving, but little expendable income. Parents own a cafe that specialises in healthy foods, and they're friends support them. But nothing else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T05:47:59-07:00","id":1334621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334618#post1334618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You know, I've been wondering. Craft (genesis) is no more. And I'm making her a medicine supernal. Does that mean she can do things like 'brew up ebola and black death, version 2.0, with less weaknesses'?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not really the purview of Medicine, so much as a Craft with absurdly high Medicine and Lore prerequisites and an amount of access to infrastructure that a fifteen-year-old with little expendable income is going to have trouble getting her hands on.<br /> <br /> \u200bPlus if she starts dabbling into that, the FBI <i>will</i> have something to charge her with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T06:06:05-07:00","id":1334624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334621#post1334621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's not really the purview of Medicine, so much as a Craft with absurdly high Medicine and Lore prerequisites and an amount of access to infrastructure that a fifteen-year-old with little expendable income is going to have trouble getting her hands on.<br /> <br /> \u200bPlus if she starts dabbling into that, the FBI <i>will</i> have something to charge her with.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm.... ok. I guess so. <br /> <br /> How about genetic engineering or plastic surgery?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T06:46:30-07:00","id":1334632,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334624#post1334624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about genetic engineering or plastic surgery?</div> </div> </div> </div>What about genetic engineering or plastic surgery?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T06:48:37-07:00","id":1334633,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334605#post1334605\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah. Threatening the family of a Solar Exalted...<br /> <br /> The American government has made many mistakes. This may be their last one.<br /> <br /> FBI whisking her away to their labs? What would they find, other than a light show?</div> </div> </div> </div>You are acting like this isn't a perfectly-valid tactic used by the Wyld Hunt in Creation. If anything, the technology advancement in the real world makes mortals more likely to be able kill Exalts, not less. Can't ignite that caste mark on your forehead when <i><u><b>you don't have a head any more</b></u></i> via large-caliber high-velocity round applied directly to the forehead.<br /> <br /> Exalted are strong, not invincible. My mortal players have killed Exalted with <i>spears</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11892-boston123","name":"Boston123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"790"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T07:02:00-07:00","id":1334636,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Boston123</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334633#post1334633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You are acting like this isn't a perfectly-valid tactic used by the Wyld Hunt in Creation. If anything, the technology advancement in the real world makes mortals more likely to be able kill Exalts, not less. Can't ignite that caste mark on your forehead when <i><u><b>you don't have a head any more</b></u></i> via large-caliber high-velocity round applied directly to the forehead.<br /> <br /> Exalted are strong, not invincible. My mortal players have killed Exalted with <i>spears</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Doesn't that run with the problems that:<br /> <br /> 1. They want to suborn her. <br /> 2. They don't know what she can do<br /> 3. Exalted have a nasty habit of grabbing technology and turning over to their own ends<br /> 4. No resistance charms, no anti-surprise charms, or just plain ass finding her (snipers are never a silver bullet)<br /> 5. If they kill her, they can't use her. A medicine supernal? Worth her weight in gold. <br /> <br /> I'm not saying that she can singlehandedly overthrow the American government (she can't, yet). Its just that her current reputation and known abilities paint her to be harmless and a benefit for the American govt. Or anybody that she's working for. You don't kill someone who can heal anything short of death (this includes lost limbs, HIV, MRSA resistant bacteria, etc). <br /> <br /> If they knew what she would eventually be capable of? Yes, the sniper bullet would come out. But they don't. This is the first exalted ever seen on the planet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T07:35:19-07:00","id":1334642,"title":"","content":"&quot;Harmless?&quot; Didn't you <i>just</i> say she was gonna brew up a new bubonic plague?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-09T08:09:37-07:00","id":1334653,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334642#post1334642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Harmless?&quot; Didn't you <i>just</i> say she was gonna brew up a new bubonic plague?</div> </div> </div> </div>No. I was asking. <br /> <br /> Its a question of capability. Not willingness. Because I'm thinking: &quot;What's the line?&quot; <br /> <br /> Can she make symbiotic bacteria? Can she do things like the penicillin producing bacteria, only for different things? What about symbiotic bacteria that produces vitamins and amino acids in the gut? Can she engineer new crops?<br /> <br /> I mean, is making something like penicillin a medicine or craft roll? What about the usage of CRISPR gene editing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T06:22:15-07:00","id":1334836,"title":"","content":"Ok. Note. For this place only. <br /> <br /> In the modern world, we know what causes aging. Or at the very least, the extracellular damage. Tellomeres shortening. The cartilage and collagen, slowly wearing away and not being properly replaced. Cancer. Osteoarthritis. Weakening and thinning of skin. <br /> <br /> So here's the question. If a Solar can regenerate limbs, heal damaged tissues, and repair crippling injuries... does that mean that he could improve quality of life for an elderly patient?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T14:54:18-07:00","id":1334981,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334836#post1334836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So here's the question. If a Solar can regenerate limbs, heal damaged tissues, and repair crippling injuries... does that mean that he could improve quality of life for an elderly patient?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that's fine.<br /> <br /> I think that'd be fine in Creation as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T14:58:48-07:00","id":1334982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334981#post1334981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that's fine.<br /> <br /> I think that'd be fine in Creation as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>What do you think should be the limit? I don't think I working indefinitely would be kosher.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T15:10:19-07:00","id":1334985,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334982#post1334982\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What do you think should be the limit? I don't think I working indefinitely would be kosher.</div> </div> </div> </div>How much effort is the Solar willing to invest and what resources does she have?<br /> <br /> I can see a hundred year old as fit as he was at 50. I can picture a hundred-and-fifty year old who looks as if she's in her 70s.<br /> <br /> Could you go further than that? Maybe. But not easily.<br /> <br /> How far into the future are you going to be taking this story?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-10T15:32:58-07:00","id":1334988,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1334985#post1334985\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How much effort is the Solar willing to invest and what resources does she have?<br /> <br /> I can see a hundred year old as fit as he was at 50. I can picture a hundred-and-fifty year old who looks as if she's in her 70s.<br /> <br /> Could you go further than that? Maybe. But not easily.<br /> <br /> How far into the future are you going to be taking this story?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah. Just... Thinking. If a Solar can ease the damage of aging. Like, say, arthritis or osteoporosis, then it'll be a great story potential. Imagine being able to make a 70 year old feel like a 25... And only one person can do it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-13T02:30:17-07:00","id":1335434,"title":"","content":"A thing I'm wondering about Princess Diana. So we have a real life healer walking around and healing people. Do you think people will get used to this novelty, or will they just forget it like they forget other things?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-13T03:01:13-07:00","id":1335443,"title":"","content":"I think it will amaze people, scientists will be keen on studying it, there'll be a load of documentaries and scientific papers both investigating it and calling it a hoax... and if no-one can work out what's going on or how it works, after a while they'll give up and stop talking about it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-13T03:08:09-07:00","id":1335446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1335443#post1335443\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it will amaze people, scientists will be keen on studying it, there'll be a load of documentaries and scientific papers both investigating it and calling it a hoax... and if no-one can work out what's going on or how it works, after a while they'll give up and stop talking about it.</div> </div> </div> </div>1. Papparazi?<br /> 2. How long will it take for them to get bored?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-13T03:30:59-07:00","id":1335451,"title":"","content":"Oh yeah, loads of papparazi.<br /> <br /> As to how long... some will get bored much quicker than others I guess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T08:48:50-07:00","id":1335733,"title":"","content":"Hmm.... A thing I'm realizing. So I've written the exaltation scene. <br /> <br /> 1. How does the Solar even 'feel' their essence?<br /> 2. How do I write the massive influx of knowledge, such that she goes from dabbler (medicine 1) to expert (Medicine 5)?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T10:35:49-07:00","id":1335748,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1335733#post1335733\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How do I write the massive influx of knowledge, such that she goes from dabbler (medicine 1) to expert (Medicine 5)?</div> </div> </div> </div>Which massive influx of knowledge would that be?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T10:42:44-07:00","id":1335749,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1335748#post1335748\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which massive influx of knowledge would that be?</div> </div> </div> </div>You know, sudden pouring of information and skill like the ones you get during exaltation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T10:47:05-07:00","id":1335752,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1335749#post1335749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You know, sudden pouring of information and skill like the ones you get during exaltation?</div> </div> </div> </div>... What?<br /> <br /> You don't get a sudden pouring of information and skill on Exaltation.<br /> <br /> You get Excellencies and other Charms. Your Ability scores don't change.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-14T10:49:26-07:00","id":1335753,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1335733#post1335733\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm.... A thing I'm realizing. So I've written the exaltation scene.<br /> <br /> 1. How does the Solar even 'feel' their essence?</div> </div> </div> </div>3e corebook has some relevant information on p. 35-36. I would definitely check out these pages if you're writing about a newly-Exalted Solar in any context, especially the &quot;Essence fever&quot; parts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11237-jefepato","name":"Jefepato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11237_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-15T01:10:45-07:00","id":1335846,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1335752#post1335752\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... What?<br /> <br /> You don't get a sudden pouring of information and skill on Exaltation.<br /> <br /> You get Excellencies and other Charms. Your Ability scores don't change.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that's awkward. If you're a 15 year old kid, you aren't going to have anything above 3, or hell, even a 2 is surprising. Perhaps I should chalk it up to past life? Or do a short training montage for grabbing information and things?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-15T05:36:46-07:00","id":1335869,"title":"","content":"Personal thoughts: <br /> <br /> Arc 1: The beginning<ul><li>Exploration of powers</li> <li>First usage of craft charms to make good food and supplies</li> <li>Medicine charms for the unhealthier people of the apartment - massages and basic medication, in return for some money</li> <li>Usage of craft charms to create clothes, repair damaged property, etc</li> <li>First usage of Food from the Aerial table</li> <li>Payment of the homeless to serve as stand-holders; no need for license for selling art</li> <li>Suits, tables, and other equipment are created via craft charms (basic and major projects, taken from the scrapyard)</li> <li>Artwork involves poetry, paintings, charcoal and ballpoint drawings, embroidery, and anything that requires low level of starting materials. Embroidery is taken from old clothes recycled.</li> <li>Money comes in. Money is used to get better material - equipment bonus ensures better quality</li> <li>More money comes in</li> <li>Laptop is bought. First usage of Godmind alogrithms. A fake name is produced, as well as a bank account. Finalization of relationship, causing ally rating to increase</li> <li>Art projects now occur at high speed. Once it was 60 dollars or so a day. Now it is hundreds (internet really streamlines shit).</li> <li>Meanwhile, she works at a vet shelter, using her medicine charms and testing them out. Access to internet means access to online publications at her own time. Medicine rises from 1 to 5 (supernal)</li> <li>Usage of subterfuge charm to enter vet clinic after-hours.</li> <li>Meanwhile, in school a friend's relative is injured (car crash? Cancer? HIV?). She goes to heal them. First usage. Then she goes and heals others.</li> <li>Subterfuge charms to sneak in after hours to heal people</li> <li>People begin to notice</li> <li>Close call with 'Destination Truth' crew.</li> <li>Computers wiped, and hijacked with a virus to prevent recording.</li> <li>This goes on for awhile, gaining more money and helping to pay off bills.</li> <li>Until there's a car crash</li> </ul><br /> Arc 2: The discovery<ul><li>Massive solar bonfire as mote reactor is activated and she begins healing a 20-car pileup</li> <li>No body dies, but in the age of smartphones, this is the end of anonymity for her</li> <li>Police intervention, bring her in for questioning</li> <li>Mass news network and social media outcry. Most dismiss it as a hoax, but the event was large and at an intersection, and so eyewitness accounts, multiple videos from various smartphones and CCTV, all converge. It gets more and more believable</li> <li>Outcry is enough such that trained doctors are brought in, to verify the powers the girl possesses</li> <li>Verification indicates that, yes, this is a thing. Yes, mass healing had occurred, and so the girl's abilities are verified by experts. Most scoff at this</li> <li>Some remember the massive bonfire anima released several months ago, in the dead of winter. Most had dismissed it as a stunt or prank, but now...</li> <li>Mass confusion and talking.</li> <li>First requests for healing come in; first a stream, then a raging river</li> <li>Healing occurs regularly, with full on experts. Derogatory comparisms to 'faith healing' is made, but they are wrong. For one thing, she's atheist. Also, she doesn't bother with speeches or theatrics. She simply separates them into two lines and flares her mote reactor to do work. And thirdly, she's perfectly fine with people coming in to watch her.</li> <li>As it becomes clearer and clearer that she's a true McCoy, more people come. People from overseas. Rich people. Powerful people. Cancer cures, repair of destroyed limbs and brains, fixing muscular dystrophy</li> <li>This comes to a head where the US government comes in and takes her into see what's happening.</li> </ul><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-15T14:40:33-07:00","id":1335947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1335846#post1335846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, that's awkward. If you're a 15 year old kid, you aren't going to have anything above 3, or hell, even a 2 is surprising. Perhaps I should chalk it up to past life? Or do a short training montage for grabbing information and things?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Exaltation chooses exceptional people. Now &quot;exceptional&quot; is what you choose to do, not how many dots are on your sheet, but if we're talking about the one person in all the world who deserves to be Exalted by the Sun, a girl who studies medicine despite all odds and expectations, then this deserving and worthy mortal is probably not a 1-dot amature in her Supernal ability.<br /> <br /> I don't know if you're familiar with the legal drama &quot;Suits&quot;, but Mike Ross is a drug dealer who never went to law school who all happens to be the greatest lawyer of all time -- worth watching the pilot episode. It's great inspiration for Exalted Modern.<br /> <br /> Training montage works. I guess. Taking an ability from 1 to 5 takes two weeks in training time (9 days for 3 to 5). It's a lot of XP though.<br /> <br /> Personally, I'd build the character mechanically and fit the story around that. I can already hear the &quot;boo hiss&quot; from the gallery, but as I see it you're either writing your own fan-fic which is loosely inspired by Exalted (in which case do what you want and who cares) or you're genuinely exploring the concept of a lone Exalt in a modern setting (in which case you should constrain yourself to what that would actually mean). And as there aren't other players and you're effectively the ST, and you have a strong character concept in mind, I see no particular disadvantage from working backwards from the mechanics.<br /> <br /> A Solar Exalt can do X. How does X effect a modern world.<br /> <br /> You want to tell a story of evolving power. How much medicine does she need to start with to tell the story you want to tell? If you want her to start with Medicine 5 Charms, maybe she should be a gifted healer since before her Exaltation, reading medical textbooks in Elementary School. If she only needs Medicine 2 Charms to start and grows into her power over weeks and months, then start her at Medicine 2. Your story outline for 1 to 5 via online journals also works.<br /> <br /> We don't have anything concrete on Past Lives in 3E, but they never increased your raw ability scores before.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 09-15-2019, 05:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-16T00:29:45-07:00","id":1336000,"title":"","content":"Fine then. 2/3 dots in medicine. I'm a bit leery of this. I have parents who are doctors. I know that its insanely hard to become a doctor. Intelligence 4, Medicine 3, at an age and circumstance where most people would give up and turn to a life of crime/ drugs, she pushes on. <br /> <br /> And here's the thing. Exaltation isn't fair. It can never be fair. The power it gives is all out of proportion to the character receiving it. I mean, look at the characters. Sometimes it comes via prayer. Sometimes, it comes in the midst of battle. Sometimes, it comes when exploring some ruins. Sometimes, it just appears when you're studying. Yes, I'm talking about Arianna. I mean what, you studied so hard that you deserve to be the greatest scholar on earth? You wokred so hard that you desere to be in the top 0.0001% of humanity? You prayed so hard, that you obtain the power to shake titans and wrestle behemoths? No, you don't. the power given out is all out of proportion to any possible human effort, and I have no issue with it going to someone who it doesn't seem to suit. <br /> <br /> The sun chooses you for personality. For potential. For ability. For desire. And most of all, the fact that you will <b><i>use </i></b>this power. <br /> <br /> Anyway, I think you have a point. Medicine 2, Intelligence 4, so in other words, better than trained professionals. No actual formal training, self-taught, but a prodigy in what she's trying to do. Were she in better circumstances, she would be in a better situation, but... well, she's stuck in the poor part of town, with not-very enthusiastic parents, and people who have pretty much given up. <br /> <br /> I suppose I should give her favored in occult, lore, medicine, craft, and melee.<br /> <br /> On the lone exalt in the modern world, how much time do you think it'll take for her to basically make other people go 'this person is really dangerous, and not just because of the leverage offered by her healing powers'. I'm thinking of them noticing her using god-mind algorithms and flawless handicraft technique, and wondering just what her limits are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-16T02:31:59-07:00","id":1336007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336000#post1336000\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On the lone exalt in the modern world, how much time do you think it'll take for her to basically make other people go 'this person is really dangerous, and not just because of the leverage offered by her healing powers'.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't want you to think that I'm not ignoring (you've got a great idea that really interests me), but it's so far out of my lived experience as a male presenting POC, I really can't comment constructively. So... I'm going to ignore that question. (Because as I said in my first post, I can only picture the cops shooting her at the scene of the car crash -- but that's my baggage and not helpful for your story.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 09-16-2019, 07:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-16T02:59:46-07:00","id":1336008,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336007#post1336007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not ignoring you. You've got a great idea that really interests me. But it's so far out of my lived experience as a male presenting POC, I really can't comment constructively.</div> </div> </div> </div>Urm.... ok. This is a bit odd...<br /> <br /> But: <br /> <br /> 1. What's your financial situation? <br /> 2. Where do you live?<br /> 3. You ever had encounters with the police?<br /> 4. I... didn't say that I was ignoring you<br /> 5. What do you think of using past life as a copout for learning sorcery?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-16T04:50:42-07:00","id":1336021,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336008#post1336008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">4. I... didn't say that I was ignoring you<br /> 5. What do you think of using past life as a copout for learning sorcery?</div> </div> </div> </div>My bad on wording there: I just mean I can't answer your question.<br /> <br /> Past Life can clue her in that sorcery exists, the Salinian Working exists as the perfect excuse for learning sorcery.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-16T04:54:06-07:00","id":1336024,"title":"","content":"Personal thought. <br /> <br /> Faith Healers. Yes, those guys. The ones with stadiums. The ones with 'miracle crusades' and 'not enough faith' and 'seed money'. The ones with megachurches and entire tv channels for them. The ones that sell miracle water and have entire beachfront houses and private jets, bought with cash. <br /> <br /> So their reaction to a real life healer? At first, disbelief. And then, as she gets more and more powerful, and the reports come streaming in, they'll realize something. That something funky is going on. Someone at there has real life healing powers. At this point, they have two choices. Attack or co-opt. <br /> <br /> They'll either try to discredit her, and when that fails, they'll try to deal with her. Either by decrying her as a witch, calling her evil, or just saying that she's the antichrist trying to lead people astray with false miracles and such. Others, will try to co-opt her. Either to try and become a 'mentor', or by claiming her as proof of god's intervention in the world (she's an atheist) and then use her as proof that magic healing can exist (she hates faith healers). <br /> <br /> On the religious part, I'm not quite sure. This is set in America, and obviously, christianity is going to play a huge part. Catholic church? Majority of christian denominations say that no more miracles this age, which is going to be awkward with someone pulling off miracle healings left and right. She's also an atheist. This is important, because I'm quite sure that I will write about the christian portion trying to get her to sign on with or endorse them. Which... she would probably not do. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T07:03:26-07:00","id":1336202,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1335947#post1335947\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't know if you're familiar with the legal drama &quot;Suits&quot;, but Mike Ross is a drug dealer who never went to law school who all happens to be the greatest lawyer of all time -- worth watching the pilot episode. It's great inspiration for Exalted Modern.<br /> <br /> Training montage works. I guess. Taking an ability from 1 to 5 takes two weeks in training time (9 days for 3 to 5). It's a lot of XP though.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>What about, say, favored skills? Don't those take near-instantaneous? Why do you think a newly minted solar exalt with medicine supernal can't have favored Medicine?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T07:32:14-07:00","id":1336208,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336202#post1336202\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about, say, favored skills? Don't those take near-instantaneous? Why do you think a newly minted solar exalt with medicine supernal can't have favored Medicine?</div> </div> </div> </div>Training times for Favored and Caste Abilities can be found in the Ex3 Core book, p. 178. Raising your dots in them takes days.<br /> <br /> \u200bAlso, no, you can't double up on an Ability by having it be Favored and Caste, or Favored and Supernal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T07:59:39-07:00","id":1336213,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336208#post1336208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Training times for Favored and Caste Abilities can be found in the Ex3 Core book, p. 178. Raising your dots in them takes days.<br /> <br /> \u200bAlso, no, you can't double up on an Ability by having it be Favored and Caste, or Favored and Supernal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well that sucks. I was thinking of 2e. Well, I'll skip it, putting it in a mixture of 2e, 3e, and kerisgame.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T08:02:49-07:00","id":1336214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336213#post1336213\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well that sucks.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agree to disagree, here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-17T11:53:21-07:00","id":1336263,"title":"","content":"Also, if you are doing this for story-writing, and not a real game, I don\u00b4t think you need to hew so closely to mechanics. &quot;What can you do with Medicine 3?&quot; would be a kinda irrelevant question: you can do whatever is correct for the story and character\u00b4s background.<br /> <br /> So, focus on doing a cool story, not on &quot;Golden Glorious Scalpel has a Medicine 4 Essence 2 requisite, so I need an excuse so she can learn it&quot;. I wish you good luck and hope it is a cool tale!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13031-clophiroth","name":"Clophiroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13031_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T12:00:03-07:00","id":1336616,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Clophiroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336263#post1336263\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don\u00b4t think you need to hew so closely to mechanics. &amp;quot;What can you do with Medicine 3?&amp;quot; would be a kinda irrelevant question: you can do whatever is correct for the story and character\u00b4s background.</div> </div> </div> </div>When you divorce the character from the mechanics you tend to get &quot;then my Solar knocked put Superman in one punch&quot;-level fanfic (or &quot;and then my Dragon-Blooded <i>really</i> Exalted and became a Solar&quot; fanfic).<br /> <br /> <br /> I realise the mechanics are to balance a game, not to simulate a world, but if you're genuinely interested in exploring what a Solar can do then I can't recommend wilfully ignoring what a Solar can't do.<br /> <br /> If, on the other hand, you just want to tell a cool story then this is good advice. And ultimately you're writing to put your cool ideas on paper and to entertain. The canon police are never going to see your character's sheet to complain she doesn't meet the Charm minimums. It's just a bit of fun in your own homebrew setting.<br /> <br /> There's nothing wrong with having your fanfic Solar KO Superman. It's just not something that would actually happen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-18T12:01:15-07:00","id":1336617,"title":"","content":"It's a thing. I know solars are mighty. I know their nature to break previous limits and boundaries.<br /> <br /> It's a problem of balance. I don't want her to be... Too powerful, too fast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T01:19:50-07:00","id":1336797,"title":"","content":"You know something? Screw it. <br /> <br /> After a 6 months of running operations, she should: <br /> <br /> Be able to fight, run, and do other athletics along with the best of mortal men<br /> Be ridiculously skilled at throwing and shooting. <br /> Start running an international operation selling art she's making on her own, all under different aliases<br /> Be able to make artwork which would take years in minutes, each of them a master piece. <br /> Have seven shadows evasion, and racing hare method<br /> Suitably good at subterfuge and stealth (capable of entering a hospital undetected, even when the guards are on alert)<br /> <br /> Now, her medicine... she should have custom charms. She probably has an entire lab, probably quite alike to a mad scientists' where she does her work. Bubbling chemicals of indeterminate origin. Bound elementals and demons, doing their work. Computers chugging away, calculating and computing something impossible, on infinite power sources. Numerous tanks of fluid, where strange creatures float in life support. Full-on biological lab with the included autoclaves, defenses, and NBC defense. A man who finds her lab should be frightened and in awe. A geneticist or an engineer who finds her lab should get on his knees and hope that she doesn't get access to real facilities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T03:06:59-07:00","id":1336812,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336797#post1336797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You know something? Screw it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why do you keep saying this? Nobody\u2019s telling you you can\u2019t do this stuff.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336797#post1336797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">After a 6 months of running operations, she should: <br /> <br /> Be able to fight, run, and do other athletics along with the best of mortal men<br /> Be ridiculously skilled at throwing and shooting. <br /> Start running an international operation selling art she's making on her own, all under different aliases<br /> Be able to make artwork which would take years in minutes, each of them a master piece. <br /> Have seven shadows evasion, and racing hare method<br /> Suitably good at subterfuge and stealth (capable of entering a hospital undetected, even when the guards are on alert)</div> </div> </div> </div>Provided that she\u2019s training herself in all these things, I don\u2019t disagree that six months isn\u2019t unreasonable (though that would eat pretty significantly into her free time).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336797#post1336797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bound elementals and demons, doing their work.</div> </div> </div> </div>If she\u2019s the only supernatural thing in a world that is otherwise <b>our world</b>, from where is she getting <b>demons and elementals?</b> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336797#post1336797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">NBC defense.</div> </div> </div> </div>Liz Lemon is protecting it? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T04:30:36-07:00","id":1336819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336812#post1336812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why do you keep saying this? Nobody\u2019s telling you you can\u2019t do this stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because I've written 3 chapters, on other sites, and no one's commenting. <br /> <br /> Maybe my writing skill is just shit, and this was a bad idea. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">If she\u2019s the only supernatural thing in a world that is otherwise </span></span></span><b>our world</b><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">, from where is she getting </span></span></span><b>demons and elementals?</b> </div> </div> </div>Our world, naturally, never had demons nor elementals. But nothing says that she can't <b>summon </b>them into our plane of existence. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\"> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">Liz Lemon is protecting it? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></span><br /> </span><br /> </span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> <br /> </span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>Nah, just things. I'm currently brainstorming things for her to make. And of course, there has to be measures taken to make sure nothing gets out. Autoclaves. Gloves. Laminar flow hoods. Incubators. Maybe symbiotic bacteria that produce vitamins to be taken up by the human body. Maybe viruses that can tailor DNA, meant to attack enemies like Muscular dystrophy. Perhaps cells that have been engineered to enter the body and do things like 'eat free radicals', 'restore damaged cartilage at joints', or 'eat plaque'. Or maybe altered versions of AIDs, where specific viruses have their contents rewritten such that they can be cures for diseases such as Lupus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T05:19:18-07:00","id":1336830,"title":"","content":"OK, if she can summon alien spirits into a world that otherwise lacks them entirely, and starts doing so en-masse, then my money is on \u201cbrings about radical changes to the world as we know it.\u201c<br /> <br /> Also the response is probably going to be a lot more hostile when she finally <i>does</i> get discovered, because miraculous healing is one thing, and commanding armies of demons to handle your drudge-work is another thing entirely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T05:23:40-07:00","id":1336835,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336830#post1336830\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">OK, if she can summon alien spirits into a world that otherwise lacks them entirely, and starts doing so en-masse, then my money is on \u201cbrings about radical changes to the world as we know it.\u201c<br /> <br /> Also the response is probably going to be a lot more hostile when she finally <i>does</i> get discovered, because miraculous healing is one thing, and commanding armies of demons to handle your drudge-work is another thing entirely.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hm.... maybe twilight mad scientist so that instead of demons, its abominations from medical science?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T05:28:27-07:00","id":1336839,"title":"","content":"I don\u2019t see people deciding the sight of cyborgs Frankensteined together out of placentas and tumors is much better than demons.<br /> <br /> Instead of enslaving spirits or mad science horrors, why not just hire the neighbor\u2019s kid? Pay him $15/hr., and make it clear the wages are contingent on him keeping his mouth shut.<br /> <br /> But again, this is your story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 09-19-2019, 08:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T05:30:12-07:00","id":1336841,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336839#post1336839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don\u2019t see people deciding the sight of cyborgs Frankensteined together out of placentas and tumors is much better than demons, but again, this is your story.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm... yes, you are right. <br /> <br /> Anyway, I've been looking through various documentaries and infographics on faith healers and lottery winners. Any good sources to spare?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T00:41:45-07:00","id":1337452,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336841#post1336841\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyway, I've been looking through various documentaries and infographics on faith healers and lottery winners. Any good sources to spare?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't watch many documentaries, I'm afraid.<br /> <br /> \u200bAlso, what's the connection, there? What do lottery winners have to do with healing?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T05:21:25-07:00","id":1337477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1336208#post1336208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Training times for Favored and Caste Abilities can be found in the Ex3 Core book, p. 178. Raising your dots in them takes days.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that along with needing a context for a Lore roll was considered a key part of 3rd edition moving away from the &quot;play as the Exaltation, not the host&quot; mentality.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T09:52:40-07:00","id":1337506,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337452#post1337452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't watch many documentaries, I'm afraid.<br /> <br /> \u200bAlso, what's the connection, there? What do lottery winners have to do with healing?</div> </div> </div> </div>Power. <br /> <br /> How do people react when a massive influx of good things go into their lives. Whether it's money or a blessing by the unconquered Sun. <br /> <br /> And there's the issue of what happens when she begins receiving millions or billions in payment when they find out she can cure anything. <br /> <br /> Anything. <br /> <br /> Do you know how much money that can bring in?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T09:58:11-07:00","id":1337507,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337506#post1337506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And there's the issue of what happens when she begins receiving millions or billions in payment when they find out she can cure anything.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately, people who grew up poor tend not to have the skillset to handle their sudden wealth. More than <i>ninety-eight percent</i> of lottery winners (for example) end up in the same financial position they were in before winning within two years, <i>or worse</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T13:48:33-07:00","id":1337533,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337507#post1337507\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unfortunately, people who grew up poor tend not to have the skillset to handle their sudden wealth. More than <i>ninety-eight percent</i> of lottery winners (for example) end up in the same financial position they were in before winning within two years, <i>or worse</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know that. And thats one problem. <br /> <br /> Remember child stars? Remember all the problems that come with it? <br /> <br /> Well, this is something bigger than a child star. <br /> <br /> I'm wondering how I should write the reveal and how the revelation of solar exaltation affects the relationship with her parents. Are they good people? People who despite their poverty, are a role model for a solar exalt to follow in their humility and compassion? Or will the sudden influx of wealth destroy them via drugs, scandals, and vice? Will they treat their daughter well, or will the taste of wealth and luxury cause them to push her to bring more for them, destroying their relationship like in many cases of child stars?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T21:49:07-07:00","id":1337587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337533#post1337533\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm wondering how I should write the reveal and how the revelation of solar exaltation affects the relationship with her parents. <b>Are they good people?</b> People who despite their poverty, are a role model for a solar exalt to follow in their humility and compassion? <b>Or</b> will the sudden influx of wealth destroy them via drugs, scandals, and vice? Will they treat their daughter well, or will the taste of wealth and luxury cause them to push her to bring more for them, destroying their relationship like in many cases of child stars?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sadly, even good people can be corrupted or destroyed; their failure in this instance doesn't have to mean they were <i>always</i> bad.<br /> <br /> \u200b(That said, given your previous indications about how the people around her were not supportive in her pursuit of the healing arts, I'm inclined to think her relationship with her parents would not be in the best place.)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T23:24:22-07:00","id":1337594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337587#post1337587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sadly, even good people can be corrupted or destroyed; their failure in this instance doesn't have to mean they were <i>always</i> bad.<br /> <br /> \u200b(That said, given your previous indications about how the people around her were not supportive in her pursuit of the healing arts, I'm inclined to think her relationship with her parents would not be in the best place.)</div> </div> </div> </div>That's the thing. I'm not quite sure on what to write them as. <br /> <br /> Well-meaning but neglectful parents who have to constantly work over time to put food on the table? Normal people, ground down by reality, and with the sudden windfall a deep and abiding fear that this will not last? (this is a thing). Bad people, who resent everything around them, including their daughter, who go to sleep thinking back on all their now-dead dreams, wondering what could have been? <br /> <br /> On the part of deep and abiding fear, I'm thinking of them perhaps pressuring or unintentionally forcing their daughter to do things she doesn't like. Like spend overtime healing. Or to 'accept' commisions from rich people to move in advance, or to get plastic surgery, or enhancements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T23:34:19-07:00","id":1337595,"title":"","content":"It's your story, Accelerator. Where do you see it going?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T23:47:38-07:00","id":1337597,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337595#post1337595\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's your story, Accelerator. Where do you see it going?</div> </div> </div> </div>I can always make it so that she becomes more and more isolated from the world at large, her realization that her parents were using her for her powers contributing to mental anguish like many other lottery winners. Combine that with the attempted assassinations by the crazies. And she might either learn sorcery and say 'fuck this shit', Bury herself in her work, or run to another country like China or Africa. Or Singapore.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-23T23:48:49-07:00","id":1337598,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337595#post1337595\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's your story, Accelerator. Where do you see it going?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm wondering what makes a good story. Based on the old adage of exalted being what happens around the Exalted herself, I'm trying to put a line between 'grimdark' and 'the world reacts to the solar, and not always in a good way'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T00:19:38-07:00","id":1337601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337598#post1337598\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm wondering what makes a good story.</div> </div> </div> </div>Heart. Thought. Vision. Understanding. Time. Truth. Imagination.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337598#post1337598\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm trying to put a line between 'grimdark' and 'the world reacts to the solar, and not always in a good way'.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally I'd lean away from the &quot;grimdark,&quot; considering how if I wanted that, I could just look at current politics. But I'm not you.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T12:51:42-07:00","id":1337675,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337601#post1337601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Heart. Thought. Vision. Understanding. Time. Truth. Imagination.<br /> <br /> Personally I'd lean away from the &amp;quot;grimdark,&amp;quot; considering how if I wanted that, I could just look at current politics. But I'm not you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking of world politics...<br /> <br /> Is it on character for the American government to kidnap their own citizens?<br /> <br /> Or, say, if a group of Chinese nationals with cancer wish to visit the healer, and mysteriously get their access blocked?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Membe