thorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T15:06:58-07:00","id":1337714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337712#post1337712\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The United States is known to pursue the capture/elimination of security threats outside of its own borders.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fine then. <br /> <br /> Since you know about how they work and how they think, what do you think they would deal with a solar exalted with a Medicine supernal? Assuming that they simply view her as someone with healing powers that glows, not as a solar exalted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T16:12:41-07:00","id":1337725,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337714#post1337714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Fine then.</div> </div> </div> </div>This seems oddly aggressive.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337714#post1337714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Since you know about how they work and how they think, what do you think they would deal with a solar exalted with a Medicine supernal? Assuming that they simply view her as someone with healing powers that glows, not as a solar exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, I\u2019m going off my history classes and the news. I \u201cknow\u201d that much.<br /> If she\u2019s working wonders the US government and intelligence apparatus etc are going to have a variety of reactions. We are talking about someone who could be mistaken for the second coming. <br /> That there sounds like a grave concern. That sounds like a cult waiting to happen. That sounds like something that needs to be in Uncle Sams employ, or throughly understood so we know if they are replicable. And someone that needs to be heavily watched, at least. My two cents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T16:56:33-07:00","id":1337732,"title":"","content":"If we're just talking someone that appears as a nigh on miraculous doctor ie treatments don't diverge much from normal treatments beyond the one performing them then not much happens. Maybe the person is tracked and kept on hand ,so to speak, for higher level emergencies as they'd want the best on for a major problem.<br /> <br /> That said more egregious charms like Wholeness-Restoration method will be bloody noticed since it tends to not matter how long a doctor spends treating something people are not particularly known for regrowing lost limbs.<br /> <br /> As Epee said most of what's going to happen would be observation and study with the attempt of replication where possible. Like if some of the treatments just appear that the Solar is better with the tools, more precise in treatments, or just has the advantage of not being wrong or missing things in the diagnosis those might be available in some fashion to normal doctors or just mark the Solar as exceptionally skilled. Curing lung cancer with Plague Banishing Incitation would be more problematic as the results would be visible at a rate unheard of to normal medicine. Mostly the big goals will be avoiding the Solar starting a cult using their tendency to glow the light of the sun and be able to perform miracles in healing could be used for that.<br /> <br /> If for some reason the solar were detained and they escaped then the escape would more than likely be used as justification for hunting the escaped Solar as fleeing custody is less than helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T17:33:33-07:00","id":1337736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337725#post1337725\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This seems oddly aggressive.</div> </div> </div> </div>Apologies. It was not intentional. It was acceptance <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I mean, I\u2019m going off my history classes and the news. I \u201cknow\u201d that much.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">If she\u2019s working wonders the US government and intelligence apparatus etc are going to have a variety of reactions. We are talking about someone who could be mistaken for the second coming.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">That there sounds like a grave concern. That sounds like a cult waiting to happen. That sounds like something that needs to be in Uncle Sams employ, or throughly understood so we know if they are replicable. And someone that needs to be heavily watched, at least. My two cents.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>And if she rebuffs all intentions at worshipping her, and loudly proclaims that she's not divine and an atheist? <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T17:38:33-07:00","id":1337738,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337732#post1337732\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If we're just talking someone that appears as a nigh on miraculous doctor ie treatments don't diverge much from normal treatments beyond the one performing them then not much happens. Maybe the person is tracked and kept on hand ,so to speak, for higher level emergencies as they'd want the best on for a major problem.<br /> <br /> That said more egregious charms like Wholeness-Restoration method will be bloody noticed since it tends to not matter how long a doctor spends treating something people are not particularly known for regrowing lost limbs.</div> </div> </div> </div>As a matter of fact, yes. One of the things I'm going to show is her, on tv, doing something undeniably and absurdly supernatural. Either regrowing someone's lost limbs, or undoing massive burns and gashes. Either way, it can't be denied. And she has nothing to hide, either, so there will be reports. Medical statements. Recorded statements from doctors that some kid was suffering from Muscular Dystrophy or Wolfram's Disease or Leukemia, until she treated them, and they're all fine now. <br /> <br /> I'm also planning to draw some parallels, in that she, like some purported faith healers, can diagnose someone by glancing at them. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Curing lung cancer with Plague Banishing Incitation would be more problematic as the results would be visible at a rate unheard of to normal medicine. Mostly the big goals will be avoiding the Solar starting a cult using their tendency to glow the light of the sun and be able to perform miracles in healing could be used for that.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>One idea I had was that, in response to the massive demand for her services, is for her to hold weekly mass healings at the local stadium, pushing herself to the limit and healing thousands at a time, flaring totemic all the while. <br /> <br /> Is that bad enough?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T18:34:47-07:00","id":1337746,"title":"","content":"Even with all the Medicine Charms in the Core, \u201chealing thousands at a time\u201d isn\u2019t really part of the Solar milieu; shit, it took Elizabeth Warren four hours to <i>take selfies</i> with thousands of people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T19:26:08-07:00","id":1337753,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337746#post1337746\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even with all the Medicine Charms in the Core, \u201chealing thousands at a time\u201d isn\u2019t really part of the Solar milieu; shit, it took Elizabeth Warren four hours to <i>take selfies</i> with thousands of people.</div> </div> </div> </div>Scratch it up to me putting in several pieces of homebrew at the same time, including Kerisgame Hacks. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_5CqA9T0dTMW7xvhRCz3uzOoHW-YKUD_kE-GeMNsJvE/pub\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_5CqA9T0dTMW7xvhRCz3uzOoHW-YKUD_kE-GeMNsJvE/pub\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_5CqA9T0dTMW7xvhRCz3uzOoHW-YKUD_kE-GeMNsJvE/pub\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1_5CqA9T0dTMW7xvhRCz3uzOoHW-YKUD_kE-GeMNsJvE/pub </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Check out 'mote reactor'. As well as homebrewed charms at Essence 4/5 that drop the cost of charms you purchase at Essence 1-2 and let you apply them to magnitudes. Its charms meant to deal with plague-stricken cities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T19:28:55-07:00","id":1337754,"title":"","content":"A thousand people in one session seems a bit too extreme for Solar medicine sadly. WRM ,Wholeness-Restoring Meditation, is noted to take a while the text mentioning at least 4 hour treatments monthly until you've gotten 20 successes if you're doing something like restoring a lost limb. Other things are probably easier, like it mentions being able to cure some forms of blindness or deafness in short order. Due to the wording, and that this is still meant to be insanely impressive, I'd put that more towards disease, or damage based loss of the sense as opposed to say losing your sight because you're missing the eye ball itself. Add in that a number of medicine charms also require willpower to work and that limits the number of healed people even more greatly.<br /> <br /> That said its not like an individual needs to be able to do the equivalent of casting mass restoration and cure greater wounds ,or whatever they were called in previous dnd editions, to enable the character to make a major impact. I mean Wound Cleansing Meditation allows one to attempt to reattach a limb with an hour of treatment and if you were to add in Body-Sculpting Essence Method and Instant Treatment Methadology to completely reattach severed limbs and fix up a person who was pretty close to death in a matter of moments. It'll eat up your WP like nobodies business, but you could perform glorious medical miracles in moments. It wouldn't take that long to start developing a reputation of being able to save almost anyone with the big drawback being known that you don't save too many at a time which of course would come with the complications of not being able to save everyone your character wants, depleting your mote and WP resources quickly, and the resentment of people who's loved ones weren't saved for whatever reason. (Ranging from burning out saving others earlier, to not being there to save someone, or just not being able to save a person who's need was unknown.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T19:42:50-07:00","id":1337756,"title":"","content":"Okay, you\u2019re using more homebrew. One thing you should probably take into account, though, is that the more unseen assumptions you fold into a work, the more confusion is going to be experienced by your audience.<br /> <br /> Imagine, for instance, if I wrote a Superman fancomic that is centered around Supes experiencing a crossover with classic 80\u2019s sitcom character Gordon Shumway, but never, ever <i>mention</i> that in the title, in the description, on the cover, et cetera., and just expect you, the reader, to accept it as-is.<br /> <br /> Also, just as a reminder, Magnitude as a system term now refers to the health track of a battle group, not any specific quantity of people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-24T19:51:08-07:00","id":1337757,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337756#post1337756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, you\u2019re using more homebrew. One thing you should probably take into account, though, is that the more unseen assumptions you fold into a work, the more confusion is going to be experienced by your audience.<br /> <br /> Imagine, for instance, if I wrote a Superman fancomic that is centered around Supes experiencing a crossover with classic 80\u2019s sitcom character Gordon Shumway, but never, ever <i>mention</i> that in the title, in the description, on the cover, et cetera., and just expect you, the reader, to accept it as-is.<br /> <br /> Also, just as a reminder, Magnitude as a system term now refers to the health track of a battle group, not any specific quantity of people.</div> </div> </div> </div>*Puts head in hands*<br /> <br /> Goddamn it, I forgot. Again.<br /> <br /> That change from 2e and 3e seems to be why I can't find the magnitude rules in the 3e corebook. I'll put in an edit in the opening post.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-25T02:53:23-07:00","id":1337784,"title":"","content":"Quotes: <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Tony Stark built this! In a cave! With a box of scraps! </div> </div> </div>How much push can I use if I'm using a medicine supernal and several crafting charms? I mean, there's always salvaging of old abandoned science equipment, as well as making her own, and using medicine charms to make up the difference. I'm thinking of a warehouse powered by several summoned elementals, with all sorts of weirdness.<br /> <br /> With a plant that can grow like kudzu (if exposed to the right elements), produces potato-like satchets and photosynthesizes with 40% efficiency, to rats that glow in the dark and have been hit by viruses that can selectively target cells for genetic editing. Computers that are currently computing protein folding and carrying out simulations of the human body. Stray cats and dogs, taken, dissected, and preserved, while several strange fetuses float within fluids, felines and canines serving as the test subjects for the worlds' first artificial wombs. Plants that synthesize sugars and other more exotic chemicals, powered by electricity. Trees that eat heat and light and can survive sandy soils, meant to be planted and give life to deserts. Watermelons that release blood when their vines are cut, whose insides resemble mincemeat than any kind of fruit flesh. Red, beating organs and other such on artificial life support, used as a test bed while artificial microbes and symbiotes travel through them, repairing damage and oxygenating them beyond what should be biologically capable. An organism that is currently bombarded with enough radiation to kill a man several times over, with the radioactive material taken from old smoke alarms, serving as a test bed for growing organisms with low mutation rate. Dozens of human limbs, organs, and tissues, all grown from the same girl, her experimentation on growing new organs bearing fruit as she replicates her body several times over. Diagrams and blueprints, indicating new structures and designed organelles, for new types of cells.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-25T05:48:42-07:00","id":1337799,"title":"","content":"Y\u2019know, more than a few of the pets to live in my house have been former strays. I probably wouldn\u2019t be very comfortable with my neighbor abducting dogs off the street to dissect them or for use in \u201cartificial womb\u201d experiments.<br /> <br /> (Also, even Solar ar\u00eate shouldn\u2019t be a guarantor that these genetic experiments go wrong in unexpected ways.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 09-25-2019, 08:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-25T12:38:17-07:00","id":1337839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337799#post1337799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Y\u2019know, more than a few of the pets to live in my house have been former strays. I probably wouldn\u2019t be very comfortable with my neighbor abducting dogs off the street to dissect them or for use in \u201cartificial womb\u201d experiments.<br /> <br /> (Also, even Solar ar\u00eate shouldn\u2019t be a guarantor that these genetic experiments go wrong in unexpected ways.)</div> </div> </div> </div>You are right. There should be a few things that go wrong. <br /> <br /> But in what form? <br /> <br /> Zombies? Monsters? Short life spans? Side effects?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-25T15:52:47-07:00","id":1337864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337839#post1337839\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Zombies? Monsters? Short life spans? Side effects?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. That'll do nicely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-25T16:31:10-07:00","id":1337872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337864#post1337864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes. That'll do nicely.</div> </div> </div> </div>How about rotting? She can regrow limbs, using craft charms, and her pure medical skill to cause pluripotent cells to form and to basically grow entire new limbs from scratch, kept alive by life support machines. <br /> <br /> But the arms keep on rotting. Something, or somewhat, is causing them to rot, making it so that the technique can't create limbs to graft onto other people without risk of sepsis. <br /> <br /> In other words, what she's doing is incredibly, ground breakingly, advanced, but its not without flaw, hence necessitating her to go out and go into multi-million dollar facilities if she wants to complete her work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-25T16:42:45-07:00","id":1337875,"title":"","content":"Don't forget new illnesses, problematic mutated forms of existing illnesses (highly resistant ones for example), or for a real fun botch effect causing a disease to jump a species barrier it previously couldn't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-25T16:51:01-07:00","id":1337877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337875#post1337875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Don't forget new illnesses, problematic mutated forms of existing illnesses (highly resistant ones for example), or for a real fun botch effect causing a disease to jump a species barrier it previously couldn't.</div> </div> </div> </div>How about a virus meant to cure things like muscular dystrophy and wolfram's syndrome... only for the virus to go rogue, and the very thing that lets it interface and bypass the defenses of the human body to alter the cells' genetic structure makes it incredibly dangerous?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-29T18:23:46-07:00","id":1338546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1337875#post1337875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Don't forget new illnesses, problematic mutated forms of existing illnesses (highly resistant ones for example), or for a real fun botch effect causing a disease to jump a species barrier it previously couldn't.</div> </div> </div> </div>I just realized something while researching for a project. You don't even need to make any fucked up shit happen for people to mistrust what's going to happen. You just need to throw in 'Scary Science!' or 'Genetic engineering!' to make people afraid. There's no need to make drawbacks. Just take advantage of natural human stupidity. <br /> <br /> Which, of course, leads to frustration as a medicine supernal tries to push through bureaucratic hell for medical cures that she knows will work, but no one will ever dare try. She has several options. 1. Try and wait. 2. Try and make it move faster. 3. Try and get one country to act as a test bed. <br /> <br /> Whether the 3rd option is a good idea, remains to be seen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-29T20:48:08-07:00","id":1338559,"title":"","content":"And of course getting resources. Doesn't matter if the concerns are reasonable or unreasonable if you don't have the supplies to do the experiment its not happening. So how do you get them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-29T21:28:52-07:00","id":1338564,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1338559#post1338559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And of course getting resources. Doesn't matter if the concerns are reasonable or unreasonable if you don't have the supplies to do the experiment its not happening. So how do you get them?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah.<br /> <br /> Or hey, you can go to a 3rd world country or a place with few civil liberties who isnt all that interested in international law for gmo distribution.<br /> <br /> I mean, you can go there and start planting your crops and bribe them with free cancer treatments. And you can probably succeed in having your sorcerously created super plants thrive and show that their concerns about their viability and growth were unfounded.<br /> <br /> You just... You know, joined hands with a 3rd world dictatorship that probably didnt have a great relationship with anybody else. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3400_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3400\" data-vbnamecard=\"3400\">nalak42</a> . A thing I'm thinking about an exalt is that they aren't... All that dependent on other people. A geneticist needs multi million dollar equipment and the scientific establishment to bounce ideas off before they can start editing rice genomes or making disease resistant maize.<br /> <br /> A solar exalt specced for medicine, crafting, and sorcerery, can probably take high school microscopes, those crispr hacking kits they sell out of garages, and the organic market produce and then produce something better. Of course, the reaction to their efforts might be 'kill it with fire!' but hey, they can succeed in that.<br /> <br /> The problem isn't Pacificas power. Her plants and drugs and treatments work. It's having to get the world to accept them when their source is a supernatural power no ones seen before and when half the people in her country are screaming that the antichrist has come in the guise of a blonde girl in a floral print shirt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-30T05:23:27-07:00","id":1338605,"title":"","content":"Huh. A thing I just realized. Something really funny. Or really dark. <br /> <br /> So let's say that Pacifica wants a sister. Maybe its a thing that she heard from her parents, how they wish for another child but couldn't afford the 9 month pregnancy and the resulting costs. Maybe its because she watches someone else play, and thinks it'll be cool to have a younger sibling she can be the big boss of. Maybe it was simply an idle thought. <br /> <br /> But she wouldn't be a 15 year old if she wasn't impulsive. So she grabs a CRISPR kit, a DIY thing that's really only meant to interfere with yeast or E. coli. But its now in the hands of a solar, which means bad things for everyone. The CRISPR is enough to act as a tool for craft (genesis), along with petri dishes, microscopes, and numerous other things. What comes out is basically a cell taken from her own eggs, the DNA is interfered with, and she goes to town on altering the genomes and casting sorcerous workings, pushing her excellency and sorcery charms and medicine supernal to reduce anything she viewed as 'flaws' and added a few new things. Like several dozen new enzymes, removal of the appendix, a revamp of the nervous system, regenerative powers for both cartilage, connective tissue, and telomeres, the power to make her own vitamin C, constant neuroplasticity, enhanced multitasking, and, well, someone who is basically captain america + <br /> <br /> And then, she cultured the cells. And then gave it to a Neomah. Which, in case you didn't know, is basically a flesh vat. <br /> <br /> Its a thought that came to me, because solars and teenagers are never that great at considering the ramifications of their actions. And, well, in a world where there is already scientific debate over genetic engineering, and there was already an outcry over modifying human embryos to be resistant to HIV, what's the reaction going to be to someone who not only crossed over the line, but rushed over it in a burning motorcycle, leaving behind a trail of fire? <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-30T08:33:20-07:00","id":1338634,"title":"","content":"Side note: have you looked at the Evocation &quot;The Silken Army&quot;? Page 27 of Arms of the Chosen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-30T17:55:25-07:00","id":1338721,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1338634#post1338634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Side note: have you looked at the Evocation &amp;quot;The Silken Army&amp;quot;? Page 27 of Arms of the Chosen.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope. Wasn't too interested. Why?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-30T23:58:20-07:00","id":1338751,"title":"","content":"It's a great example of being able to perform Medicine actions on a massive scale, admittedly via an artifact.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T00:04:41-07:00","id":1338753,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1338751#post1338751\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's a great example of being able to perform Medicine actions on a massive scale, admittedly via an artifact.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is it too much to ask for details, or should i just go buy it myself?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T00:08:12-07:00","id":1338754,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1338753#post1338753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it too much to ask for details, or should i just go buy it myself?</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1196730-alucard-gets-his-grubby-hands-on-aotc\"><i>Arms of the Chosen</i> is a pretty awesome book for a number of other reasons. I highly advocate that you give it a shot; it's well worth it.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 10-01-2019, 03:13 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T04:43:35-07:00","id":1338765,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1338754#post1338754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1196730-alucard-gets-his-grubby-hands-on-aotc\"><i>Arms of the Chosen</i> is a pretty awesome book for a number of other reasons. I highly advocate that you give it a shot; it's well worth it.</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Just found it. Turns out I bought it a long, long time ago. <br /> <br /> I see it now. Solars have mortal boosting and mass training Charms. Perhaps making a charm that let's you create personal assistants for a scene, or a mass rapid Empowerment charm like a souped up legendary scholar, trading duration for time ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T05:51:19-07:00","id":1338769,"title":"","content":"Well, that's specifically granted via an Artifact; she might have a tougher time of it without access to the magical materials. I mean, per your own dictates, this is taking place in <i>our</i> world, in which items don't just develop the capacity for mystical powers just because you wield them in a way resonant with an overarching story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T06:10:25-07:00","id":1338771,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1338769#post1338769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, that's specifically granted via an Artifact; she might have a tougher time of it without access to the magical materials. I mean, per your own dictates, this is taking place in <i>our</i> world, in which items don't just develop the capacity for mystical powers just because you wield them in a way resonant with an overarching story.</div> </div> </div> </div>True. But oadenols codex says that there are thaumaturgical procedures that can transform normal materials into MM. <br /> <br /> Huh. Lead to gold. Neat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T06:34:42-07:00","id":1338774,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1338771#post1338771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">True. But oadenols codex says that there are thaumaturgical procedures that can transform normal materials into MM.</div> </div> </div> </div>Does thaumaturgy exist on Earth?<br /> <br /> \u200bCharms are one thing, as they're miraculous expressions of a Solar's peerless mastery of a mortal skill; the separate existence of a network of accessible magical rituals does <i>not</i> jibe with your repeated assertions that this is supposed to be an approximation of the world that you and I live on.<br /> <br /> \u200b(Also as a reminder, per Ex3, thaumaturgy isn't just something you can just decide to learn.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 10-01-2019, 09:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T06:47:40-07:00","id":1338776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1338774#post1338774\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does thaumaturgy exist on Earth?<br /> <br /> \u200bCharms are one thing, as they're miraculous expressions of a Solar's peerless mastery of a mortal skill; the separate existence of a network of accessible magical rituals does <i>not</i> jibe with your repeated assertions that this is supposed to be your approximation of the world that you and I live on.<br /> <br /> \u200b(Also as a reminder, per Ex3, thaumaturgy isn't just something you can just decide to learn.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Well..... <br /> <br /> Apologies for the misunderstanding. But I thought I made this clear. This is earth, just like us... and then a wild solar appears. It isn't just a solar. Its the idea that we aren't living in science fiction land. We're living in mythic fantasy, only that we're from the boonies, where nothing supernatural happens. Until a wild solar appears<br /> <br /> <br /> (note: Something along the lines of The Times of Cascading Years occurred, only that it was permanent, it occurred after the destruction of 99.9% of the Exalted Host, and it gave multiple universes. Lots of them. Ranging from Discworld, to single flatlands, to our Earth. You can travel in between them using thaumaturgy, science, or sorcery. We're just unlucky in that we're isolated, and the current lack of essence means that there aren't demenses. Reality for us is, for lack of a better word, extra-calcified. Until the eruption of Solar Essence shifts things up). <br /> <br /> Yes, but we can use Ex2, which not only has long long lists of thaumaturgical protocols we can use, but its also very much not stupid, does not wipe out half the fun things you can do as a mortal, and also provides a much needed backdrop for the topic of &quot;Folk Magic&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T07:18:59-07:00","id":1338783,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1338776#post1338776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But I thought I made this clear.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not by half.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1338776#post1338776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is earth, just like us... and then a wild solar appears. It isn't just a solar. Its the idea that we aren't living in science fiction land. We're living in mythic fantasy, only that we're from the boonies, where nothing supernatural happens. Until a wild solar appears.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, but if she was born &quot;in the boonies, a world where there's nothing supernatural happening,&quot; where is she learning thaumaturgy <b>from</b>?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1338776#post1338776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">it gave multiple universes. Lots of them. Ranging from Discworld, to single flatlands, to our Earth.</div> </div> </div> </div>Our Earth, you mean, that's been around for billions of years and has only had humans for hundreds of thousands?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1338776#post1338776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">its also very much not stupid.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just because you don't like something doesn't mean it's stupid. And frankly doing so is a good way to upset people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T20:46:11-07:00","id":1338921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1334460-on-being-the-lone-supernatural-exalt-in-modern-word?p=1338783#post1338783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Our Earth, you mean, that's been around for billions of years and has only had humans for hundreds of thousands?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. A mishmash of alternate timelines, retcons, and a reality rewriting effect. Sure, in this universe, humans evolved on an essence-poor earth with no demenses nor spirits nor gods, but they still have that vital two-soul structure. On another world, they were forged from clay by a maimed god who made a mistake in their smithing, and so have a broken soul. On another world, they sprung from the ground, and their two-soul structure was a sign of their earthly connection, and connecting them turned them into spirits or granted supernatural power, etc. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T01:20:29-07:00","id":1343357,"title":"","content":"A personal thought. There's a thing I realized. <br /> <br /> My Exalt doesn't need a hospital. She doesn't need to become an intern, or work at an animal shelter so that she can practice her medical skills. <br /> <br /> She has herself! And her essence. And her Exaltation. I mean, there's literally a charm that lets you obviate need for tools and medicines when carrying out medicinal actions. And considering that she's got impurity hammering blow and a craft excellency and peerless craftsmanship, she can probably do shit like 'prepare sulfa drugs from a high school chemistry set', like a Walter White, only a good kind. This, adding in simply looting old dilapidated classrooms and abandoned hospitals (I see no problem with this. In a city with plenty of abandoned cities there's always things left behind, including scalpels and any kind of laboratory equipment no one's bothered to help clean up). In other words, with flawless diagnostic technique letting her ignore the issues of having no x-ray, MRI, or blood test equipment, she can basically operate her own Operating room in an abandoned warehouse. <br /> <br /> Adding to this, there's sorcery. Currently, she's nothing special. Just cirrus skiff, stalwart servitor, food from the aerial table, and water from stone. At this point, she's gotten herself a water supply and a source of electricity (I'll eat my hat if she can't create a generator. A stalwart servitor can move 40 tons without stopping). So she has medicine, barest medical tools, water, electricity, and beds she salvaged from the trash bins. <br /> <br /> You know what that means? <br /> <br /> Back alley medicine.<br /> <br /> Now this nicely mashes with america's many problems with healthcare. It is quite possible that for a girl who, say, had her face bitten off by a dog/ knocked out by a horse, and then told that, no, it doesn't matter that your face looks like a horror mask, your insurance doesn't cover it, and so they have to choose between being homeless and getting an ok face. Not to mention numerous other issues, like lack of insurance. Lacking insurance will probably mean any and any forms of medicine and treatment would be absurdly expensive, leading to them either not affording it, or simply risking losing their homes because medicine is so expensive. There is also pretty much the issue of bankruptcy. Since medical bills are expensive, they can drive you to bankruptcy, ruining your credit rating and making it so that you can't afford loans. Want to afford going to college or that new car or just maintaining your home? Sorry, pal, no can do. <br /> <br /> There's also the issue of medicine and painkillers and mind drugs. Since there's always the issue of opioid crisis to consider, its possible that the first person to enter the makeshift back alley hospital is actually someone with, say, a slipped or herniated disc, looking for some medical supplies to help alleviate that 'oh god please kill me' suffering, with maybe being convinced to get some impromptu surgery beause, hey, what do you have to lose? This applies for things like cancer, or broken arms/ legs (solar surgery means you can be back in the pink of health the next morning). And many more, ranging from diabetes to asthma. Minor things can probably be treated with thaumaturgical substances, while actual difficult things like diabetes would involve either rewiring the immune system or regrowing the pancreas. <br /> <br /> So you now have a back alley doctor that's better than anyone else. Congragulations. There's lots and lots of people on the street desperate enough to see a doctor that would treat them for free, or at least, be prepared to give them painkillers. The fact that talking to her for 15 minutes means that you would get a bonus against things like exhaustion and depression for the rest of the month means that they'll probably come back again. Of course, since this is back-alley doctoring, she can't just... go up and start advertising. So things start going out on word of mouth for people who can't afford normal treatments or who just don't want to go to hospitals. This lady here has breast cancer. This one has arthritis. This one has a damged knee. This one has diabetes. All healed by the end of the day, and then they just go home to spread the word. <br /> <br /> Like, &quot;Hey, I know that you probably can't afford the treatment the hospital offers, but I know this one really good doctor who doesn't charges much. Yes, she's a 15 year old girl, but my friend of a friend and a friend says...&quot; Or, hell, thaumaturgical potions that let you survive on 4 hours of sleep a night, that when boosted with solar craft and occult charms, hold no side effects whatsoever. Or a thaumaturgical product that burns away <br /> <br /> Which of course leads back to illegal practice of medicine. Obviously, its illegal. No surgery, diagnosis, or giving of drugs can be carried out without a doctor's license. Which means conflict.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-23T11:28:58-08:00","id":1350470,"title":"","content":"What would be the most interesting place to hypothetically place an exalt?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}